    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "At Heffernan Auctioneers we love to sell unique family homes - this property certainly fits that bill. \r\nThis wonderful family home is designed around today's family lifestyle with generous living accommodation & spacious bedrooms combined with warm welcoming finishes ensuring it will appeal as a super family home. It is ideally positioned on 0.32ha / 0.79 acres of mature grounds just minutes from Edenderry Town. This is an attractive welcoming residence sure to impress even the most discerning purchaser. \r\nThe living accommodation consists of livingroom, lounge room, kitchen / dining, utility, guest w.c. & four bedrooms(main ensuite) and family bathroom\r\nOutside are generous mature landscaped gardens, beautiful patio area with enclosed playground for children, large garage and tarmac driveway all enhance this lovely house. \r\nViewing of this beautiful, spacious family home is highly recommended by appointment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ent porch:\t\t\t\tTiled floor.\r\nEnt Hall: \t\t\t\tSolid wood floor.  Inset lighting.  Alarm keypad.\r\nLivingroom:\t\t3.3m x 6.5m\tSolid wood floor.   Feature fireplace with insert stove.  \r\nBay window with insert lighting. Ceiling coving & cornice.\r\n T.V. & phone points.  Double doors to kitchen / dining.\r\nKitchen / dining:\t5.2m x 3.3m  \tCountry cream fitted kitchen.  Tiled floor & wall surround.  \r\n\t\t\t\t\tDouble doors to livingroom.  French doors to patio area & rear garden.\r\nUtility:\t\t\t3.5m x 2.5mm\tTiled floor. Plumbed for washer / dryer.  Tiled floor.Door to rear garden.  \r\nGuest w.c.:\t\t0.98m x 2.44m \tTiled floor & wall mounted vanity unit.  W.c. & w.h.b.\r\nLounge room\t:\t3.9m x 3.6m\tWood floor. Feature open fireplace.  T.V. point. \t\r\nBedroom 1:\t\t3.3m x 5.2m\tWood floor.  Built in wardrobes.   Bay window T.V. point.\r\nEnsuite:\t\t1.16m x 2.3m\tTiled floor & wall surround. Electric shower. W.c. & w.h.b.\r\nBedroom 2:\t\t3.3m x 3.3m\tWood floor.  \r\nBedroom 3:\t\t3.19m x 3.3m\tWood floor.  Dado rail.\r\nBedroom 4:\t\t3.3m x 3.3m\tWood floor.  T.V. point.\r\nBathroom:\t\t2.1m x 3.3m\tTiled floor & wall surround.  Bath, shower, wall mounted vanity unit, w.c. & w.h.b.\r\nOutbuildings:\r\nGarage:\t\t\t\tConcrete floor.  Electric roller doors."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Superb condition throughout.\r\nTarmac driveway.\r\nLandscaped gardens.\r\nPatio area to rear.\r\nBarna shed to rear.\r\nEnclosed play area for children to rear.\r\nSalt water treatment system for all water throughout the house.\r\nNew double glazed windows fitted to rear of property.\r\nDetached garage with electric shutter door.\r\nAlarmed.\r\n5 min drive to Edenderry.\r\n20 min drive to M4 motorway.\r\n50 min drive to Dublin."
      }
    ],
